    {
      "question": "If I choose this Character with the \"You may return 1 Character to your hand:\" effect of \"OP01-047 Trafalgar Law\" and trash 1 of my Life cards instead, can I still use the effect of \"OP01-047 Trafalgar Law\" to play a Character with a cost of 3 or less from my hand?",
